// modemSetups (@217): the ROM's built-in modem setups (NPG chapter 25, "Modem
// Setup Service"), sorted by modemName: |GetModemSetUpAndXvert1.X| falls back
// to them (BFetch by name) when the system soup has no setup of that name, and
// GetAllModemSetUpNames merges their names with the soup's. Each is a modem
// setup frame - modemprefs (the modem preferences option) and ModemProfile:
// the modem's speeds, the serial speed it is configured at (configSpeed),
// command timeout and inter-command delay in milliseconds, and the
// configuration string sent for each kind of connection (no error control,
// error control only, error control with fallback, cellular, direct).

